        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/dms3rep/multi/v2+TWoR-Open+Day_Website+Banner+1200+by+700+v2.png\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h4>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Explore your study options for 2025\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Nau mai haere mai ki Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa! We're opening our doors to the general public!\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Come and find out who we are and what makes our qualifications unique.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Meet some of our p\u016bkenga (tutors)\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Interactive activities\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        <span>\r\n          \n             \ufeff\n            \r\n        </span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Enrolment support\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Get course information\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Study advice\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Campus tours\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Kai timo (There will be kai available)\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
